<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - PacifiCorp cut at Furman.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - PacifiCorp cut at Furman.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Furman Selz said it cut PacifiCorp to hold from buy on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Shares lost 1/4 to 20-7/8.</p>
<p>-- The company said after the market close on Wednesday that it was disappointed with the state of Utah's proposal for an immediate cut in electricity prices.</p>
</text>
